---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LeadForm from '../components/LeadForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us | Concrete Murrieta, CA"
  description="Learn about Murrieta Concrete — a licensed local concrete contractor serving Murrieta and the Temecula Valley since 2010. Driveways, patios, walkways, and decorative concrete with a 10-year workmanship guarantee."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-primary text-white py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight">About Murrieta Concrete</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Driveways &amp; Patios Built to Last</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Our Story</h2>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:text-primary text-gray-700 space-y-4">
      <p>
        Murrieta Concrete was founded in 2010 with a single focus: pouring driveways that last. Over the
        years, homeowners kept asking us to do more — patios, walkways, pool decks, decorative finishes —
        and we grew to meet that demand. Today we're a full-service hardscaping contractor serving
        Murrieta, Temecula, Wildomar, and the surrounding Temecula Valley.
      </p>
      <p>
        From the beginning, we've operated on a simple philosophy: do the job right or don't do it at all.
        That means proper subbase preparation, the right concrete mix for inland Southern California's heat
        and UV conditions, correctly spaced expansion joints, and clean, consistent finishing from edge to edge.
        Shortcuts in concrete work show up fast — and they cost the homeowner far more to fix than they saved
        upfront. We've built our reputation by refusing to cut those corners.
      </p>
      <p>
        The result is a 10-year workmanship guarantee we stand behind without fine print, and a customer
        base that sends us referrals every week. More than 60% of our work comes from repeat customers
        and neighbor referrals — the clearest sign we know of that we're doing things right.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why We're Different -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary text-center mb-10">Why We're Different</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-primary/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary text-lg mb-2">10-Year Guarantee</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">We stand behind every pour. If your concrete fails due to our workmanship — cracking, settling, or delamination caused by our installation — we return and fix it at no charge. No fine print, no runaround.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-primary/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-3 7h3m-3 4h3m-6-4h.01M9 16h.01"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary text-lg mb-2">Fully Permitted</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">We handle all City of Murrieta and Riverside County permits and inspections on your behalf. Your project is code-compliant from day one — protecting your property value and keeping your homeowner's insurance valid.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-primary/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary text-lg mb-2">Local Expertise</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Inland SoCal has its own demands — summer heat above 100°F, intense UV, and occasional frost in winter. We use concrete mixes and curing techniques specifically chosen for Murrieta's climate, not generic specs designed for coastal California.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Team -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Our Team</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Our crews are experienced concrete finishers and project managers who live and work in the Temecula
      Valley. Every team member is background-checked, and our lead finishers bring an average of 12 years
      of concrete experience to every job. We're familiar with local soil conditions, grading requirements,
      and HOA approval processes throughout Murrieta, Temecula, and Wildomar.
    </p>
    <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      You'll deal directly with an experienced project manager from estimate through completion — no
      hand-offs to a call center, no subcontractors who've never set foot in Murrieta. When we say we know
      this area, we mean it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Credentials -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary text-center mb-10">Our Credentials</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-primary/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-1">CA Licensed Contractor</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Licensed by the California Contractors State License Board (CSLB).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-primary/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-1">Fully Insured</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Full general liability and workers' compensation insurance on every job, every day.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-primary/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-1">Free Written Estimates</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">On-site estimates at no charge, in writing, with no pressure to commit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Area -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary text-center mb-4">Our Service Area</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
      We serve homeowners and property owners throughout Murrieta and the greater Temecula Valley.
      Free on-site estimates anywhere in our service area.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      {['Murrieta', 'Temecula', 'Wildomar', 'Menifee', 'Lake Elsinore', 'Canyon Lake', 'Winchester', 'Hemet', 'Perris'].map(city => (
        <span class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700 shadow-sm">{city}</span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-primary py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready for New Concrete? Get Your Free Estimate</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-lg mb-8">
        Tell us about your project and we'll come out, assess your site, and give you a written quote —
        no obligation, no pressure.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block bg-white text-primary font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-lg hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors shadow-lg"
      >
        Get a Free Estimate
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <LeadForm heading="Or Fill Out the Form Below" />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
